{"id": "58196", "title": "鬼刹君心", "author": "季璃", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 11, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/58/58196.htm", "intro": "都是她这双媚眼儿惹的祸啦！ \r\n　　眸光水亮迷离，眨巴间竟勾引起他的邪肆念头， \r\n　　被他蛮横地强掳回右相府邸 \r\n　　她可是个冰清玉洁的闺女儿呢！ \r\n　　怎可由他放浪挑逗 \r\n　　无耻之徒将她的抗拒挣扎当成故作纯真与演戏 \r\n　　毫不留情地做着令她羞得无地自容的行径 \r\n　　从点到为止的亲来亲去…… \r\n　　天啊！难道真如他所说，她是个淫娃儿？！", "base": "files/article/html/58/58196", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "8299719.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第一章", "file": "8299721.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "8299725.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "8299727.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "8299728.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "8299729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "8299731.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "8299739.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "8299742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "8299744.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "8299746.html", "available": false}]}